                       "texto_apoio":  "After several leaks revealed how much personal data was being collected without users\u0027 full understanding, a major tech company came under intense scrutiny from regulators and privacy advocates alike. Lawmakers in multiple countries have since proposed stricter rules requiring clearer consent before companies can collect or share user information.",
