                       "id":  "ingles-108",
                       "texto_apoio":  "In several countries, youth unemployment remains persistently higher than overall unemployment, even during periods of economic growth. Economists point out that young people entering the job market for the first time often lack the specific experience employers request, creating a cycle in which they struggle to gain the very experience needed to be hired.",
