                       "id":  "ingles-117",
                       "texto_apoio":  "Companies have deployed AI chatbots to handle routine customer service questions, freeing human agents to focus on more complex cases. Customer satisfaction surveys show mixed results: simple issues, like tracking a package, are often resolved faster than before, but customers report frustration when chatbots fail to understand more nuanced complaints.",
