                       "texto_apoio":  "Audiobooks have become one of the fastest-growing segments of the publishing industry, appealing to commuters and multitaskers who want to enjoy books while driving or doing chores. Some authors have noted that narration style can significantly affect how a story is received, leading publishers to invest heavily in choosing the right voice for each title.",
