                       "id":  "ingles-134",
                       "texto_apoio":  "As tools capable of generating original songs from simple text prompts become more sophisticated, record labels and musicians are pushing courts to clarify who owns the rights to AI-generated music, especially when the software was trained on existing copyrighted songs without explicit permission from the original artists.",
