                       "texto_apoio":  "As solar panel installations from a decade ago begin reaching the end of their lifespan, the industry faces a growing challenge: there is currently limited infrastructure to recycle the glass, silicon, and metals inside old panels, and many end up in landfills instead of being processed into materials for new panels.",
