                       "texto_apoio":  "Popular destinations that once welcomed tourism as an economic blessing are now struggling with its consequences: overcrowded streets, rising housing costs for locals pushed out by short-term rentals, and natural sites damaged by the sheer volume of visitors. Some cities have begun limiting daily visitor numbers or taxing tourists directly to fund infrastructure repairs.",
