                       "texto_apoio":  "Apps offering AI-powered companions designed to chat, listen, and offer emotional support have grown popular among users who describe feeling less alone after using them. Some mental health professionals worry, however, that relying on an artificial companion that always agrees and never challenges the user could deepen isolation rather than genuinely address it, by replacing rather than encouraging real human connection.",
